  "description": "Too many people and we lose an edge 🔪- An update for potential New Subscribers.",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>Current Subscribers are 👉 NOT 👈 impacted by this.</strong></p><p><strong>I say again: Current Subscribers are 👉 NOT 👈 impacted by this.</strong></p><p>When the hollow orange checkmark in my profile turns full orange, I will be increasing <em><strong>NEW subscriber</strong></em> membership fees. Here is why:</p><ul><li><p>The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a> is consistently winning, and providing relatively large returns in short periods of time. Trading systems lose their edge when <em><strong>too many people </strong></em>use them.</p><ul><li><p>Too many people moving in on a mid-cap or small-cap stock can cause liquidity spikes in assets. My goal is to not move stock price or provide easy cash to market makers. This is why I do not review small-cap stocks on TikTok anymore…It is mathematically possible for me to move stocks and I prefer to not have an SEC investigation.</p></li><li><p>Additional <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-screener-results-2-weeks?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener results are here</a>, and <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Frequently Asked Questions</a> are here.</p></li><li><p>Below are the performances of the #1 stocks, tracked by a member independent of me. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RKLB&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> soared over 30% over 9 days. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RGTI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> was the only true loser of the bunch, but clawed its way back into profit over 10 days. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$OKLO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> another top performer, nearing 10% gain in just a few days.    </p><ul><li><p>Win rate in the first 24 hours: 12/16 = 75%</p></li><li><p>Average win % in first 24 hours: 4.12%</p></li><li><p>Current all time win rate: 13/16: 81%</p></li><li><p>Current all time average %: 2.45%</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"327\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/media_upload/comment/8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005/6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:327,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wNQk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2F8cb0c439-b4ed-4617-b55c-4cd9d6685005%2F6a79449f-b6da-4bc7-809b-7722a5501949.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok Screener #1 Picks Performance</figcaption></figure></div></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p><em><strong>Small, tight knit community</strong></em>. We have a great group of mature, intelligent stock traders. I do not want a massive community. I want to be available to talk, answer questions and get to know people on a personal level. Not spend 80% of my time moderating disruptive users who lower the quality of discussion. </p></li><li><p>Our Substack is consistently in the fastest rising for Crypto and Finance. It varies day to day…but on several days I have noted #1 for crypto (no idea why… I barely cover it), and top 30 fastest rising for finance.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"395\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/abdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:395,&quot;width&quot;:413,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:52054,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/165551109?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gvqz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fabdaf4ec-ce1b-4169-b304-abe593fdf71b_413x395.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Varies day to day. #1 in Crypto several times, and #21 fastest rising in Finance </figcaption></figure></div></li></ul><p>Everything has been discussed publicly in the chat…the screener results, the price hike for <em><strong>new</strong></em> members, current Substack metrics and how to approach this bittersweet problem. I will not do a “tiered” system, as these are notorious for pump and dumps. You’re either in, or not. And if you choose not, THATS OK! I still put out tons of free content and market reviews. <strong>We are currently growing at ~8% per month with 893 subscribers.</strong> At this rate, the full orange check market will be here soon with 1000+ subscribers.</p><p>I do not know how much I will raise new membership fees. But it will be an amount to actually sway people <em><strong>away.</strong></em> </p><p>This may not be the most exciting announcement, but its important and I want to be upfront about this in advance. The good news, by technical definition, we officially entered a bull market today! 🥳</p><p>Regardless your decision, thank you for your support…everyday I am grateful for all the amazing people I meet and converse with. If you have any questions, feel free to ping me in the chat, or send me a Direct Message, I am more than happy to respond directly. </p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you like Timothy’s stock market analysis and regular updates, consider subscribing for more information. </p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901e